# Generated files must stay LF on all platforms.
# The TanStack generator always emits LF (prettier default, no endOfLine
# option), while Windows checkouts with core.autocrlf=true land as CRLF —
# that mismatch makes writeIfDifferent rewrite every dev run and leaves a
# stat-dirty M with an empty diff. Pinning eol=lf keeps checkout and output
# identical so regeneration becomes a no-op.
**/routeTree.gen.ts text eol=lf
compile-lab/file-routes.d.ts text eol=lf
